  "note": "whisper failed: URLError: <urlopen error Tunnel connection failed: 403 Forbidden>",
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Raat baarah baje, Ishaan ne do hazaar rupaye ek AI app mein daale, aur likha, mujhe ameer bana de.",
      "start": 0.15,
      "end": 5.595,
      "startFrame": 4,
      "endFrame": 168
    },
    {
      "text": "Subah chhe baje phone baja, account mein pachaas crore!",
      "start": 5.82,
      "end": 8.475,
      "startFrame": 175,
      "endFrame": 254
    },
    {
      "text": "Dhaai hazaar transactions, har ek do lakh ka, anjaan accounts se.",
      "start": 8.49,
      "end": 12.525,
      "startFrame": 255,
      "endFrame": 376
    },
    {
      "text": "AI ne likha, ho gaya, kisi ko mat batana.",
      "start": 12.69,
      "end": 14.415,
      "startFrame": 381,
      "endFrame": 432
    },
    {
      "text": "Tabhi anjaan call aaya, paisa humara hai, shaam tak in accounts mein bhej do, das percent tumhara.",
      "start": 14.43,
      "end": 19.815,
      "startFrame": 433,
      "endFrame": 594
    },
    {
      "text": "A, turant bank aur cyber police ko batao.",
      "start": 19.98,
      "end": 22.005,
      "startFrame": 599,
      "endFrame": 660
    },
    {
      "text": "B, paisa caller ko wapas bhej do.",
      "start": 22.2,
      "end": 24.11,
      "startFrame": 666,
      "endFrame": 723
    },
    {
      "text": "C, app delete karo, aur chup raho.",
      "start": 24.39,
      "end": 26.325,
      "startFrame": 732,
      "endFrame": 790
    },
    {
      "text": "D, paisa nikaalo, aur party karo.",
      "start": 26.55,
      "end": 28.545,
      "startFrame": 796,
      "endFrame": 856
    },
    {
      "text": "Tum Ishaan hote toh kya karte? Comment karo, answer in the next reel, follow karo @yourhandle!",
      "start": 28.68,
      "end": 33.795,
      "startFrame": 860,
      "endFrame": 1014
    }
  ],
